    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edition includes:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight Murder Club</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Round up your friends and turn off the lights</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/6fc35aefa669881597ee2f1096b1f1de.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/6fc35aefa669881597ee2f1096b1f1de.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/6fc35aefa669881597ee2f1096b1f1de.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Midnight Murder Club is a chaotic and hilarious horror party game where every match is a new tale of screaming, surprises, and stumbling through the dark. Surrounded by your favorite troublemakers and armed with only a flashlight and a revolver, you\u2019ll tiptoe and whisper your way through traps, toys, and total chaos, where proximity chat turns whispers into jump scares and chaos into comedy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Welcome to the Midnight Murder Club</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/76bf56ab9e2a61c183de11c1621f09dc.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/76bf56ab9e2a61c183de11c1621f09dc.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/76bf56ab9e2a61c183de11c1621f09dc.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conceal your identity behind a mask and join friends in a game of perception, deception, and sharpshooting. The difference between light and dark is important as members are forced to choose between the safety of darkness and the risk of clicking on a flashlight. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on your senses. In the darkness, every decision counts. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >One Purchase Covers the Crew</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/573d0c60f4fa06d81eb018e1028b425b.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/573d0c60f4fa06d81eb018e1028b425b.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/573d0c60f4fa06d81eb018e1028b425b.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy Midnight Murder Club and invite up to five friends to join your matches. Have your friends download the Guest Pass Edition at no additional cost\u00b9 to play with you. Every game mode, every whisper in the dark, no holding back. After all, what\u2019s a mansion full of murder and chaos without some company?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Wildcards Mode</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/d8b759fb657763af1d2363917ec216ce.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/d8b759fb657763af1d2363917ec216ce.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/d8b759fb657763af1d2363917ec216ce.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival isn\u2019t just about skill, it\u2019s about bending the rules. Stack the deck in your favour with Wildcards, powerful game-changers that shake up every match. Fill the mansion with bear traps, adjust the team sizes, shoot through walls, play with gigantic bobble heads, or go out in a blaze of glory\u2026 <i>literally</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add unpredictable twists and a personal touch to your matches with rule-breaking effects that keep everyone on their toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this mode, chaos is always in the cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Whispers in the Dark</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/cb14ee4e1485fe0cd2e79fae0c98b286.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/cb14ee4e1485fe0cd2e79fae0c98b286.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/cb14ee4e1485fe0cd2e79fae0c98b286.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full proximity chat leads to tense and hysterical moments as you feel your way through the mansion\u2019s dark corridors. Hear muffled footsteps as someone runs down the hallway above you, then creep toward gunshots bleeding through the door to the next room. Hear your rivals\u2019 laughter echo through the tall ceilings after you emerge victorious from a gunfight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvE Mode: Graveyard Shift</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/5df6f6c37d3e5df99b57a3ef46459ffd.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/5df6f6c37d3e5df99b57a3ef46459ffd.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/5df6f6c37d3e5df99b57a3ef46459ffd.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every threat in the mansion wears a mask. Team up with a friend to face the supernatural forces lurking the dark halls in Graveyard Shift. Hunt down golden relics and return them to the vault while fending off waves of twisted demons, creeping shadows, and blazing skulls. The longer you last, the stronger your opposition gets, because the mansion won\u2019t go down without a fight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Devil\u2019s Toys</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/fdab26db6be7cb258476c490459e91ac.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/fdab26db6be7cb258476c490459e91ac.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/fdab26db6be7cb258476c490459e91ac.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hidden around the mansion are traps, weapons, and other equipment to help you survive the night. Take night vision pills to see in the dark. Attach a falling chandelier trap to the ceiling. Immobilize your enemies in a bear trap or light them ablaze with a molotov cocktail. The variety of items makes every match unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/f99b710da707c53bdef0838bc652e235.poster.avif?t=1755186448\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/f99b710da707c53bdef0838bc652e235.webm?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2698870/extras/f99b710da707c53bdef0838bc652e235.mp4?t=1755186448\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the Club and die trying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b9Account for PlayStation\u00ae and Internet connection required.</p>",
